 {
  "key": "email_change",
  "name": "Change Email Address",
  "subject": "Confirmez votre nouvelle adresse FlashMiam",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\" />\n<title>Nouvelle adresse e-mail</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f3f0\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Confirmez votre nouvelle adresse e-mail FlashMiam.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f6f3f0\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 12px\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px\">\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 8px 18px\">\n          <a href=\"https://flashmiam.fr\" style=\"text-decoration:none\">\n            <img src=\"https://flashmiam.fr/icon-192.png\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;border-radius:9px;border:0\" />\n            <span style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-left:8px;font:700 19px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1917\">FlashMiam</span>\n          </a>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ece6e1;border-radius:20px\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n          <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 32px 6px;font:700 24px/1.25 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1917\">Nouvelle adresse e-mail</td></tr>\n          <tr><td style=\"padding:6px 32px 10px;font:16px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1917\">Vous avez demandé à utiliser <b>{{ .NewEmail }}</b> pour votre compte FlashMiam (au lieu de {{ .Email }}). Touchez le bouton pour confirmer.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td style=\"padding:22px 32px 4px\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"border-radius:999px;background:#c2410c\">\n              <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font:600 16px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px\">Confirmer ma nouvelle adresse</a>\n            </td></tr></table>\n          </td></tr>\n          <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px 28px\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"border-top:1px solid #ece6e1;padding-top:16px;font:13px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6b6460\">Vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande ? Ne touchez pas le bouton et changez votre mot de passe dans FlashMiam (Profil › Mot de passe).</td></tr></table>\n          </td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 12px 0;font:12.5px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6b6460\">\n          FlashMiam · les restaurants et les bons plans de La Roche-sur-Yon<br />\n          <a href=\"https://flashmiam.fr\" style=\"color:#6b6460\">flashmiam.fr</a> · <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/flashmiam85/\" style=\"color:#6b6460\">Instagram @flashmiam85</a>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
 },
